<p>It's like a space in the shape of a nautilus shell&#8230; space&#8230; nautilus. Could it be? An <em>astro&#8230;nautilus</em>!?</p>
<p>In other news, this is nicely heartwarming/adorable, sad, and really crazy at the same time. It reads to me like you've took a good emotional theme, and built all of the weirdness as a frame for the theme. Reminds me a little of <a href="/scp-1782">SCP-1782</a>, and it manages to circumvent the main gripe I have about some of the really 'out there' article, since it doesn't for a moment feel like you're being bizarre for the sake of being bizarre.</p>
<p>+1, gold star and everything. You've done a really great job here, and good job for getting help with it.</p>

